course: dictionary
lesson: 909
title: Blackish: nearly black
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word «blackish» is built from «black» and the ending «-ish». The ending means «rather» or «a bit», so blackish means nearly black, or black with a little of another colour in it. You can use the same ending in greenish, reddish and smallish.
explain: The sentence «a blackish, bulgy nose, as big as a boot» tells you the nose is not pure black. It is a dark colour that is nearly black, and the word «bulgy» paints a picture of its shape.
explain: Blackish has a second meaning too: rather dark and dirty-looking. Writers use it to build a gloomy mood. A blackish river or sky in a story often warns the reader that danger or bad weather is coming.
fact: Blackish is an adjective, a describing word for something.
fact: The ending «-ish» means rather or a bit, as in greenish, reddish and smallish.
fact: «Blackish» means nearly black, or black with a little of another colour in it.
fact: In stories, «blackish» can mean rather dark and dirty-looking, and it often warns of danger or bad weather.
fact: Scientists use colour words like blackish to describe rocks, beetles and birds.
exercise: «The elephant had a blackish, bulgy nose, as big as a boot.» What does blackish mean here? | Sparkling silver | Bright green, like fresh grass | Bright white | *Nearly black
exercise: What does the ending «-ish» mean in a word like blackish? | Not at all | Twice as much | Always | *Rather or a bit
exercise: In a story, a blackish sky over the wood most likely suggests what? | *Bad weather or danger coming | A birthday party | Snow in summer | A sunny picnic
test: Which word means a bit red? | *reddish | redish | rediness | redly
test: A pupil says blackish means pure black. Is she right? | No, it means bright white | Yes, it means shiny | *No, it means nearly black | Yes, it means exactly pure black
exam: Why is blackish a useful word in a story about a dark wood? | *It paints a dark, gloomy picture | It makes the wood sound loud | It means the wood is full of cake | It shows the wood is brand new
